        "Id": "10cf625c-7a3c-406c-b649-2681af7fe37a",
        "Type": "usercreated",
        "Title": "The Shapeshifter: Sapienza",
        "Location": "LOCATION_COASTALTOWN",
        "PublicId": "103067488562",
        "ScenePath": "assembly:/_PRO/Scenes/Missions/CoastalTown/_scene_octopus.entity",
        "TileImage": "$($repository 9ee7b5bc-2a0a-4303-bcaf-4fcce64022cb).Image",
        "Description": "You are the Shapeshifter, ruthlessly stalking your prey and taking on their shape with every kill.\r\rAfter being rudely awakened from your peaceful sleep, you decide to become a part of society and work as a gardener for Silvio Caruso. Unfortunately, the other workers don&apos;t seem to appreciate you, and even Father Francesco has declared you a public enemy. Go and teach them a lesson!\r\r(Originally made by me in Hitman 2)",
